        <mxCell id="aac-legend-notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Red name&lt;/b&gt;: attached to nothing (an unattached disk, NIC, public IP...). &lt;b&gt;Faded&lt;/b&gt;: outside what you asked for, shown because something inside uses it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every shape keeps its resource ID, type, location, resource group and subscription (Edit &amp;gt; Edit Data, or hover); Ctrl+click opens it in the Azure portal.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Edit freely: move, restyle, add notes and shapes. &lt;b&gt;Export-AACDiagram -Update&lt;/b&gt; refreshes the diagram from Azure and keeps your changes - new resources are added and marked, removed ones greyed out (-Prune deletes them)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2A41;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="512" width="900" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
